  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will assist the Government of Sri Lanka&apos;s efforts to reduce the compounded effects of the global food and financial crisis on the displaced populations in the Northern Province of Sri Lanka, by reducing malnutrition rates among pregnant and lactating women and children below five years of age.</narrative>
